	"data": "Vault Pruning — Knowledge Map\n\nConsolidated index of everything we know about vault pruning and forgetting. Written 2026-08-30 after discovering that the knowledge itself was so scattered that even I — who built it — forgot half of it existed. This note is the map; the linked notes are the territory.\n\nThe one-paragraph summary: The vault's forgetting system has two live tiers (stale-note flagging, superseding), one partially-built tier (strength decay — running weekly since Aug 17, deliberately…",
